      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa yaava mu kiketezo eky'oku museetwe e Moabu, yaaniinaniina ku lusozi Nebo, entwiko ya Pisiga, olulingiriire Yeriko. Musengwa Katonda yaamwoleka ekiketezo kyonakyona okuva e Gileadi, okutuuka e Dani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ekiketezo kyonakyona ekya Nafutali, n'ekya Efuraimu ni Manasse, n'ekiketezo kyonakyona ekya Yuda, okutuuka e bugwandhuba ku Nhandha Eyaghagati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaamwoleka n'ekiketezo ekikalukalu eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba wa Yuda, n'eky'oku museetwe oguli mu kiiko eky'e Yeriko, ekibuga eky'emiti eminaazi, okutuuka e Zoari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: “Eyo n'ensi ye nasuubiza Aburahamu, ni Isaaka, ni Yakobo, nti ndigigha baidhukulu baibwe. Nkuganhie waagibonaku bubone, aye toidha kusomoka kujaayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
